  TextFields:
  - "<line-height=250%>CERES 12 Observatory\r<br>Route: WI-DC-22 / CER-12<br>Drop
    Point: Node 7F"
  - "Sorry we can\u2019t talk more on the radio. The channel is only for CERES business
    regulated pretty tightly by the Recovery Board. They issued Elijah a warning
    right before he left. So here\u2019s everything I wanted to say: I MISS YOU TOO.
    I\u2019m so glad we're working together! And please be careful. Elijah was acting
    strange before he left. I don't want you getting roped into his wild goose chase.
    \n\nGosh, it\u2019s good to hear your voice.   \n-Dad"
